To search from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
The piece is the slice of alphabet from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches target, set found to spot, return.
Search from spot plus 1.

To scan from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of seen, return.
If item spot of seen matches rendered, set duplicate to 1, return.
Scan from spot plus 1.

To finish.
Set duplicate to 0.
Scan from 0.
If duplicate is 0, The copy is a copy of rendered, Place copy into seen.

To glue from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of word, finish, return.
Set target to the slice of word from spot to spot plus 1.
Set found to -1.
Search from 0.
The letter is found.
Place item letter of codes into rendered.
Glue from spot plus 1.

For each entry in words.
Set word to entry.
Set rendered to empty text.
Glue from 0.

Report the number of items in seen.
